<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA'S YPF H1 NET $451 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA'S YPF H1 NET $451 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30. Net $451 million vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: YPF SA provided no comparatives, EPS or ADR for the first half and no second quarter results.</p>
<p>The company said that as of June 30 its net worth stood at $6.51 billion. It also reported retained earnings of $1.63 billion.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
